# The sentinel non-growth audit (scripts/audit-external-seed-sentinel-nongrowth.cjs)
# runs as a Cloud Run Job from this image and reads its per-lane watermarks from this
# fixture; re-include it so the image carries the ratchet that ships with the code.
!tests/fixtures/external_seed_sentinel_watermarks.json
scripts/demo-*.mjs
docs/integrations/*.md

# google-github-actions/auth writes its credential file into the workspace (gha-creds-<hash>.json,
# create_credentials_file defaults to true), and `COPY . .` would bake it into the image. For WIF the
# file carries the job's OIDC request token; it is inert once the job ends, but no image should hold
# it. build-gateway-image.yml builds from this workspace right after the auth step.
gha-creds-*.json
